COLLEGE DEPARTMENT INFORMATION

1. Department of Computer Science and Engineering (CSE)
Head of Department: Dr. R. Anitha
Location: Block A, 2nd Floor
Established: 2005
Overview: The CSE department offers undergraduate (B.Tech) and postgraduate (M.Tech) programs focusing on software engineering, artificial intelligence, data structures, algorithms, and computer networks. The department has 4 computer labs equipped with high-performance systems and GPU servers for AI/ML research.
Faculty Strength: 22 professors and assistant professors
Contact: cse@college.edu.in | Phone: 0452-2345678 (ext. 201)

2. Department of Electronics and Communication Engineering (ECE)
Head of Department: Dr. S. Muthukumar
Location: Block B, 1st Floor
Established: 2000
Overview: The ECE department focuses on VLSI design, embedded systems, signal processing, and communication systems. It houses an advanced Signal Processing Lab and an IoT Innovation Center.
Faculty Strength: 18 professors and assistant professors
Contact: ece@college.edu.in | Phone: 0452-2345678 (ext. 202)

3. Department of Mechanical Engineering
Head of Department: Dr. K. Balasubramaniam
Location: Block C, Ground Floor
Established: 1998
Overview: Offers programs in thermal engineering, manufacturing, robotics, and CAD/CAM. Includes a Robotics and Automation Lab and a Workshop facility.
Faculty Strength: 20 professors and assistant professors
Contact: mech@college.edu.in | Phone: 0452-2345678 (ext. 203)

4. Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering (EEE)
Head of Department: Dr. P. Lakshmi
Location: Block B, 2nd Floor
Established: 2002
Overview: Covers power systems, control systems, renewable energy, and electric drives. Has a dedicated Power Electronics Lab.
Faculty Strength: 15 professors and assistant professors
Contact: eee@college.edu.in | Phone: 0452-2345678 (ext. 204)

5. Department of Information Technology (IT)
Head of Department: Dr. M. Selvakumar
Location: Block A, 3rd Floor
Established: 2008
Overview: Focuses on web technologies, cloud computing, cybersecurity, and database management. Runs a Cybersecurity Research Lab in collaboration with industry partners.
Faculty Strength: 16 professors and assistant professors
Contact: it@college.edu.in | Phone: 0452-2345678 (ext. 205)

